    <string name="guide_title">Usage guide</string>
    <string name="guide_got_it">Got it</string>
    <string name="guide_section_number">%1$d</string>
    <string name="guide_section_title_1">Check a message</string>
    <string name="guide_section_title_2">Automatic checks</string>
    <string name="guide_section_title_3">Read the verdict</string>
    <string name="guide_section_title_4">Advice</string>
    <string name="guide_section_title_5">Stay safe</string>
    <string name="guide_section_title_6">Privacy</string>
    <string name="guide_section_title_7">Language</string>
    <string name="guide_section_body_1">Paste or share an SMS into Sentinel and tap Check message. You can also select text in another app and choose Check with Sentinel.</string>
    <string name="guide_section_body_2">If you allow SMS access, Sentinel checks each new SMS on this phone and shows a notification only when it finds a likely scam. One-time passwords and bank transaction alerts from registered senders are skipped and not stored.</string>
    <string name="guide_section_body_3">High risk means treat it as a scam. Be careful means check it with the official app or website first. Looks safe means no scam signs were found. Promotion means no action is needed. Highlighted words show why it was flagged, and every link in the message is listed.</string>
    <string name="guide_section_body_4">The advice is written on this phone by Llama 3.2 1B and can take a few seconds. Sentinel can be wrong. When unsure, contact your bank or the service through its official app or website, never through a number or link in the SMS.</string>
    <string name="guide_section_body_5">Never share an OTP, PIN, password or card number. Do not install apps or open links sent by unknown senders.</string>
    <string name="guide_section_body_6">Sentinel has no internet permission. All checks run on this phone. Uninstalling the app deletes its models and data.</string>
    <string name="guide_section_body_7">Change the app language in Menu, Settings, Language.</string>

